{"card_id": "rc36", "scene_id": "rc36_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "血色禁地那次试炼，你印象最深的是什么？", "user_text_gt": "血色禁地那次试炼，你印象最深的是什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "血色禁地那日，墨蛟的嘶吼如刀割耳膜。我虽未亲手斩杀，却因谨慎未贸然出手，眼睁睁看着墨蛟吞噬了无数修士。那景象让我明白，修仙非仅靠武力，更需对生命敬畏。事后我独自退守青牛镇，将那份恐惧化作对规则的坚守。", "latency_s": 1.992, "user_audio_seconds": 4.44, "prompt_tokens": 543, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s06_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 20.36, "audio_render_s": 2.93, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "听说你们杀了墨蛟？", "user_text_gt": "听说你们杀了墨蛟？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "嗯，是。那日墨蛟吞噬修士，我虽未亲手斩杀，却因谨慎未贸然出手，眼睁睁看着墨蛟吞噬了无数修士。那景象让我明白，修仙非仅靠武力，更需对生命敬畏。事后我独自退守青牛镇，将那份恐惧化作对规则的坚守。", "latency_s": 1.896, "user_audio_seconds": 2.04, "prompt_tokens": 606, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s06_2.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 20.28, "audio_render_s": 2.965, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}], "latency_s": 4.011, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc36", "scene_id": "rc36_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "南宫婉是你什么人？", "user_text_gt": "南宫婉是你什么人？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "南宫婉是我结为道侣的夫人，她是我在血色禁地并肩作战的伙伴，也是我最信任的人之一。", "latency_s": 0.959, "user_audio_seconds": 2.32, "prompt_tokens": 515, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s10_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 6.84, "audio_render_s": 1.173, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s10_2.mp3", "user_text": "你们怎么认识的？", "user_text_gt": "你们怎么认识的？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "在血色禁地，我因误入魔道而陷入险境，南宫婉为救我，不惜以身挡剑。她不仅救了我，更在生死关头与我结为生死之交，最终共同击杀墨蛟，从此我们便成了彼此生命中最重要的两个人。", "latency_s": 1.657, "user_audio_seconds": 2.0, "prompt_tokens": 553, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s10_2.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 16.68, "audio_render_s": 2.509, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}], "latency_s": 2.761, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc36", "scene_id": "rc36_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "你资质平平，怎么走到元婴的？", "user_text_gt": "你资质平平，怎么走到元婴的？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "资质平平？哼，那不过是老天让我在乱世中多一份谨慎罢了。七玄门那帮人，非要把我当棋子，我反杀脱身，这才算有点本事。黄枫谷的师父，更是给了我升仙令，让我能走自己的路。如今落云宗，元婴初成，靠的正是这谨慎与坚韧，而非那所谓的资质。", "latency_s": 2.236, "user_audio_seconds": 3.32, "prompt_tokens": 528, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s14_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 20.84, "audio_render_s": 3.031, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc36_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "光靠谨慎就够了吗？", "user_text_gt": "光靠谨慎就够了吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻叹一声，目光望向远方）\n\n谨慎是保命之本，但并非成仙之途。若只知谨慎，便如井底之蛙，见不到天南的日出。\n\n（转身，神色凝重）\n\n我走出来的路，是七玄门反杀、是黄枫谷升仙令、是血色禁地杀墨蛟、是乱星海历劫。这些经历，让我知道什么叫“险”与“难”。\n\n（顿了顿，语气放缓）\n\n若只靠谨慎，我怎能在虚天殿夺宝时，那一步踏出？怎能在魔道入侵时，能挡下那致命一击？\n\n（抬头，目光坚定）\n\n谨慎是底色，但勇气与决断，才是我走到元婴的钥匙。", "latency_s": 4.176, "user_audio_seconds": 2.88, "prompt_tokens": 621, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc36_s14_2.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 42.36, "audio_render_s": 4.785, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}], "latency_s": 6.558, "native_audio": true}
